# Blocks

## Admonitions

Seven types are known, and any other word makes a generic container.

::: note "A note"
The type word is part of the fence line, not a plugin's convention.
:::

::: warning "A warning"
Longer fences nest shorter ones, so a container inside a container widens
outward rather than guessing.
:::

::: tip "A tip"
Titles are straight-quoted on the fence line.
:::

::: danger "Danger"
The same shape carries every type.
:::

## Collapsible sections

::: details "What the details extension does"
It renders a real `<details>` and `<summary>`, so the browser does the work and
it still prints expanded.
:::

